{"id":14472,"author":"BmB","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHi - We are Bad Company! You may remember us from about 10 months ago. We are a group of friends who slowly merged into a great team! We are going to put our future behind us and progress to the best team we possibly can!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWe are aiming to be a top-tier team and get as far as we can in the tournament! We will be a serious in scrims but we will have fun doing it!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eCo-Owner: Robin_DD_J\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eCo-Owner:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://avicus.net/bmb\" title=\"Link: http://avicus.net/bmb\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eBmb\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eCo-Owner:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://avicus.net/Tazz\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Link: http://avicus.net/Tazz\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-famil